{"suttaId":"tha-ap501","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2812,2844],"vripara":"93"},"segments":{"tha-ap501:0.3":"Naḷakuṭidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap501:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, hārito nāma pabbato;","tha-ap501:1.3":"Sayambhū nārado nāma, rukkhamūle vasī tadā.","tha-ap501:2.1":"“Naḷāgāraṃ karitvāna, tiṇena chādayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap501:2.3":"Caṅkamaṃ sodhayitvāna, sayambhussa adāsahaṃ.","tha-ap501:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap501:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap501:4.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, naḷakuṭikanimmitaṃ;","tha-ap501:4.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ, tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ.","tha-ap501:5.1":"“Catuddasesu kappesu, devaloke ramiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap501:5.3":"Ekasattatikkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap501:6.1":"“Catutiṃsatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap501:6.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap501:7.1":"“Dhammapāsādamāruyha, sabbākāravarūpamaṃ;","tha-ap501:7.3":"Yadicchakāhaṃ vihare, sakyaputtassa sāsane.","tha-ap501:8.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap501:8.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, naḷakuṭiyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap501:9.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap501:10.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap501:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap501:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā naḷakuṭidāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap501:13.1":"Naḷakuṭidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
